{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/test?t=1760460931\" /></span><br>After narrowly escaping the chopping block, Mark is on a mission to get his head back. Sneak past deranged farmers, survive deadly traps, and fumble through barns and backwoods in a physics-driven platformer where movement is erratic and nothing goes as planned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/test2?t=1760460931\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNSTABLE PHYSICS-LAYERED MOVEMENT \u2013 CHAOS BY DESIGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/98ac1da7560b26d9c874116a7e22b199.poster.avif?t=1760460931\" width=930 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/98ac1da7560b26d9c874116a7e22b199.webm?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/98ac1da7560b26d9c874116a7e22b199.mp4?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark doesn\u2019t walk; he reacts. Every input applies force, not direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run too fast and you\u2019ll overshoot. Stop too hard and he skids out of control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is unpredictable, physical, and always teetering on disaster.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AERIAL ACROBATICS \u2013 FLAP, HOVER &amp; DASH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/0e0a959b66776f5ea598dc8b6733a69b.poster.avif?t=1760460931\" width=930 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/0e0a959b66776f5ea598dc8b6733a69b.webm?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/0e0a959b66776f5ea598dc8b6733a69b.mp4?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flap to gain height, hover to slow your fall, and peck-dash to cover ground fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain them to reach distant ledges, skip sections, or correct bad jumps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But overdo it, and Mark loses control midair, crashing down in a stumble.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH &amp; PANIC \u2013 GET SPOTTED, LOSE CONTROL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/658ce59e1c304163c0bcf026036b1416.poster.avif?t=1760460931\" width=930 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/658ce59e1c304163c0bcf026036b1416.webm?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/658ce59e1c304163c0bcf026036b1416.mp4?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through cornfields, hide in hay, and avoid roaming farmers and their dogs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If they spot you, Mark panics \u2014 bolting full speed, totally uncontrollable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is no longer to control him, but to survive wherever he decides to go.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEADS WILL ROLL\u2013 AND SO WILL YOUR POWERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/7e1ece80c2e1d15b04d160f05ce57f80.poster.avif?t=1760460931\" width=930 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/7e1ece80c2e1d15b04d160f05ce57f80.webm?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/7e1ece80c2e1d15b04d160f05ce57f80.mp4?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark\u2019s quest isn\u2019t just about getting his head back. It\u2019s about trying on a few new ones along the way. Each collectible head changes how you play:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farmer Head \u2013 Blend in with enemies until you make a move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbit Head \u2013 Burst forward with chaotic speed for a short time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog Head \u2013 Launch higher and farther with a few boosted jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ram Head \u2013 Charge into enemies and knock them senseless.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAVERSAL &amp; CHAOTIC STRATEGY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.poster.avif?t=1760460931\" width=930 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.webm?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.mp4?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm is full of traps, fire gets, electrical fences, and worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goats headbutt, horses kick, and chickens launch eggs like mortars, often at the worst possible moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden chicks, risky shortcuts, and off-path secrets if you\u2019re bold (or desperate) enough to look.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for fans of physical comedy, stealthy chaos, and movement that fights back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark\u2019s not graceful. Mark\u2019s not smart. Mark doesn\u2019t have a head. But he might make it.</p></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102980?t=1760460931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102980?t=1760460931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/523b974d2a48c38e4c7fefd044e55ba6138a3a19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760460931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/523b974d2a48c38e4c7fefd044e55ba6138a3a19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760460931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_d