_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.webm?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/extras/c465f6e01600c620ade5f8857f4e8a56.mp4?t=1760460931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm is full of traps, fire gets, electrical fences, and worse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goats headbutt, horses kick, and chickens launch eggs like mortars, often at the worst possible moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden chicks, risky shortcuts, and off-path secrets if you\u2019re bold (or desperate) enough to look.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for fans of physical comedy, stealthy chaos, and movement that fights back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark\u2019s not graceful. Mark\u2019s not smart. Mark doesn\u2019t have a head. But he might make it.</p></p>","developers":["AppleBomb Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3766700","name":"Mark The Headless Chicken"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102980/7c7fed4faf5d34635cb0238d1ebcfdd9c10c8251/header.jpg?t=1760460931","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Mark The Headless Chicken Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["AppleBomb Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"Play as a headless chicken on the run from deranged farmers in a stealthy, physics-driven platformer. Dodge traps, sneak through barns, and cause chaotic mayhem as you fight to get your head back.","steam_appid":4102980,"support_info":{"email":"gamesapplebomb@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":null}